{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00208","headline":"吊白居易 · 宣宗皇帝","name":"吊白居易","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缀玉联珠六十年，谁教冥路作诗仙。\n浮云不系名居易，造化无爲字乐天。\n童子解吟《长恨曲》，胡儿能唱《琵琶篇》。\n文章已满行人耳，一度思卿一怆然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「吊白居易」条，撰者管遗瑞、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}